---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="editorial page-width">
    <p class="eyebrow">WHY ZAHARI EXISTS</p>
    <h1>
      Make room
      <br />
      for wonder.
    </h1>
    <p class="lead">
      A quieter way to spend time with the things that interest you.
    </p>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Start with a sample.</h2>
      <p>
        The public sample is an artwork you can orbit, light and photograph. Try
        it in lowland, over the Pacific, or among the clouds.
      </p>
      <h2>Eight distinct coin worlds.</h2>
      <p>
        AAVE, BNB, BTC, ETH, LINK, SOL, UNI and XAUT are the first subjects.
        Each keeps its own shape and identity. Market data and relevant news are
        planned to shape the paid worlds; the sample remains illustrative.
      </p>
      <h2>What can I do now?</h2>
      <p>
        Explore the public sample or create an account to save your place.
        Choose among four local-time lighting moods, rotate the artwork and save
        images to your device.
      </p>
      <h2>How will membership work?</h2>
      <p>
        Membership prices are $4.99 for one coin, $8.99 for five coins, and
        $12.99 for all eight launch coins per month. The public sample is not a
        membership tier.
      </p>
      <a href={Astro.locals.user ? "/studio" : "/signup"} class="button">
        Step inside
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
